Account and profile information

Messages and communication data

Device and usage information for security and performance

Advertising-related data (non-intrusive ads)

3. Messages & Communication

Messages are transmitted securely. While private, messages may be reviewed if necessary to:

Investigate reported abuse

Enforce our Terms of Service

Comply with legal obligations

4. How We Use Information

Your data is used to:

Provide chat and messaging services

Maintain platform safety

Improve app functionality

Deliver notifications

5. Data Sharing

We do not sell personal data. Information is only shared when required for app functionality, legal compliance, or safety enforcement.

6. Advertising

MiamorChat may display advertisements. Advertisers do not receive access to your private messages or chat content.

7. Data Security

We apply reasonable technical and organizational safeguards to protect your information. No method of transmission is 100% secure.

8. Your Rights

You may:

